{"id":"478e22ff3fd55015","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution.md","title":"Definition — 自由变量与无捕获替换","display":"Definition — 自由变量与无捕获替换","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution","aliases":["14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution"],"display":"Definition — 自由变量与无捕获替换","depends_on":["[[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]","[[14-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 自由变量与无捕获替换"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0d0e27d414f41634\" href=\"?note=0d0e27d414f41634\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms\">14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e987275dbc75bae6\" href=\"?note=e987275dbc75bae6\" title=\"14-df-formula\">14-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0d0e27d414f41634\" href=\"?note=0d0e27d414f41634\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms\">14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms</a> 的签名；项、上下文与公式采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0d0e27d414f41634\" href=\"?note=0d0e27d414f41634\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms\">14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e987275dbc75bae6\" href=\"?note=e987275dbc75bae6\" title=\"14-df-formula\">14-df-formula</a> 的有限树编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 遍历项和公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\\in\\operatorname{Var}_S\">\\(x,y,z\\in\\operatorname{Var}_S\\)</span>，单替换中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{S,\\operatorname{sort}(x)}\">\\(t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{S,\\operatorname{sort}(x)}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf b\\in\\{\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{imp}\\}\">\\(\\mathsf b\\in\\{\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{imp}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\mathsf{all},\\mathsf{ex}\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\mathsf{all},\\mathsf{ex}\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}\\)</span> 在项上的定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0d0e27d414f41634\" href=\"?note=0d0e27d414f41634\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms\">14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fresh}_s\">\\(\\operatorname{Fresh}_s\\)</span> 的输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Var}_S\">\\(A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Var}_S\\)</span> 为有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in S_0\">\\(s\\in S_0\\)</span>。同时替换输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma=(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_S(\\vec x,\\vec y)\">\\(\\sigma=(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_S(\\vec x,\\vec y)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_n),\\vec y\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\">\\(\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_n),\\vec y\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\\)</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\sigma=\\operatorname{Subst}(u,\\vec x,\\sigma)\">\\(u\\sigma=\\operatorname{Subst}(u,\\vec x,\\sigma)\\)</span>。单替换按语法树高递归；新鲜变量替换不增加树高，捕获分支的两次递归均在比当前量词式低的树高上进行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf{top})=\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf{bot}):=\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf{eq}(t,u)):=\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(u),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf{rel}(r,\\vec t)):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{FV}(t_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf{top})=\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf{bot}):=\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf{eq}(t,u)):=\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(u),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf{rel}(r,\\vec t)):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{FV}(t_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf b(\\varphi,\\psi)):=\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi),\\qquad\\operatorname{FV}(Q(y,\\varphi)):=\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{y\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf b(\\varphi,\\psi)):=\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi),\\qquad\\operatorname{FV}(Q(y,\\varphi)):=\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{y\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Vars}(x):=\\{x\\},\\quad\\operatorname{Vars}(\\mathsf{app}(f,\\vec t)):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{Vars}(t_i),\\quad\\operatorname{Vars}(\\mathsf{top})=\\operatorname{Vars}(\\mathsf{bot}):=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Vars}(x):=\\{x\\},\\quad\\operatorname{Vars}(\\mathsf{app}(f,\\vec t)):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{Vars}(t_i),\\quad\\operatorname{Vars}(\\mathsf{top})=\\operatorname{Vars}(\\mathsf{bot}):=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Vars}(\\mathsf{eq}(t,u)):=\\operatorname{Vars}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{Vars}(u),\\quad\\operatorname{Vars}(\\mathsf{rel}(r,\\vec t)):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{Vars}(t_i),\\quad\\operatorname{Vars}(\\mathsf b(\\varphi,\\psi)):=\\operatorname{Vars}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{Vars}(\\psi),\\quad\\operatorname{Vars}(Q(y,\\varphi)):=\\{y\\}\\cup\\operatorname{Vars}(\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Vars}(\\mathsf{eq}(t,u)):=\\operatorname{Vars}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{Vars}(u),\\quad\\operatorname{Vars}(\\mathsf{rel}(r,\\vec t)):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{Vars}(t_i),\\quad\\operatorname{Vars}(\\mathsf b(\\varphi,\\psi)):=\\operatorname{Vars}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{Vars}(\\psi),\\quad\\operatorname{Vars}(Q(y,\\varphi)):=\\{y\\}\\cup\\operatorname{Vars}(\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fresh}_s(A):=(\\mathsf{var},s,\\min\\{n\\in\\mathbb N\\mid(\\mathsf{var},s,n)\\notin A\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Fresh}_s(A):=(\\mathsf{var},s,\\min\\{n\\in\\mathbb N\\mid(\\mathsf{var},s,n)\\notin A\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x[t/x]:=t,\\quad y[t/x]:=y\\quad(y\\ne x),\\quad\\mathsf{app}(f,u_1,\\ldots,u_k)[t/x]:=\\mathsf{app}(f,u_1[t/x],\\ldots,u_k[t/x]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x[t/x]:=t,\\quad y[t/x]:=y\\quad(y\\ne x),\\quad\\mathsf{app}(f,u_1,\\ldots,u_k)[t/x]:=\\mathsf{app}(f,u_1[t/x],\\ldots,u_k[t/x]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{top}[t/x]:=\\mathsf{top},\\quad\\mathsf{bot}[t/x]:=\\mathsf{bot},\\quad\\mathsf{eq}(u,v)[t/x]:=\\mathsf{eq}(u[t/x],v[t/x]),\\quad\\mathsf{rel}(r,\\vec u)[t/x]:=\\mathsf{rel}(r,u_1[t/x],\\ldots,u_k[t/x]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{top}[t/x]:=\\mathsf{top},\\quad\\mathsf{bot}[t/x]:=\\mathsf{bot},\\quad\\mathsf{eq}(u,v)[t/x]:=\\mathsf{eq}(u[t/x],v[t/x]),\\quad\\mathsf{rel}(r,\\vec u)[t/x]:=\\mathsf{rel}(r,u_1[t/x],\\ldots,u_k[t/x]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf b(\\varphi,\\psi)[t/x]:=\\mathsf b(\\varphi[t/x],\\psi[t/x]),\\qquad Q(x,\\varphi)[t/x]:=Q(x,\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf b(\\varphi,\\psi)[t/x]:=\\mathsf b(\\varphi[t/x],\\psi[t/x]),\\qquad Q(x,\\varphi)[t/x]:=Q(x,\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q(y,\\varphi)[t/x]:=Q(y,\\varphi[t/x])\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q(y,\\varphi)[t/x]:=Q(y,\\varphi[t/x])\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu_s(\\varphi,t,x,y):=\\operatorname{Fresh}_s(\\operatorname{Vars}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{Vars}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu_s(\\varphi,t,x,y):=\\operatorname{Fresh}_s(\\operatorname{Vars}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{Vars}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q(y,\\varphi)[t/x]:=Q(z,(\\varphi[z/y])[t/x])\\quad(y\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s,\\ y\\ne x,\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FV}(t),\\ z=\\nu_s(\\varphi,t,x,y)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q(y,\\varphi)[t/x]:=Q(z,(\\varphi[z/y])[t/x])\\quad(y\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s,\\ y\\ne x,\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FV}(t),\\ z=\\nu_s(\\varphi,t,x,y)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{AlphaCong}_S(R)\\iff{}&amp;R\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}(S)^2\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\\ (\\varphi,\\varphi)\\in R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\\ ((\\varphi,\\psi)\\in R\\Rightarrow(\\psi,\\varphi)\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\\ ((\\varphi,\\psi)\\in R\\land(\\psi,\\theta)\\in R\\Rightarrow(\\varphi,\\theta)\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathsf b\\in\\{\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{imp}\\}\\ \\forall\\varphi,\\varphi&#39;,\\psi,\\psi&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad((\\varphi,\\varphi&#39;)\\in R\\land(\\psi,\\psi&#39;)\\in R\\Rightarrow(\\mathsf b(\\varphi,\\psi),\\mathsf b(\\varphi&#39;,\\psi&#39;))\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Q\\in\\{\\mathsf{all},\\mathsf{ex}\\}\\ \\forall x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_S\\ \\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad((\\varphi,\\psi)\\in R\\Rightarrow(Q(x,\\varphi),Q(x,\\psi))\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Q\\in\\{\\mathsf{all},\\mathsf{ex}\\}\\ \\forall s\\in S_0\\ \\forall x,y\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad(y\\notin\\operatorname{Vars}(\\varphi)\\cup\\{x\\}\\Rightarrow(Q(x,\\varphi),Q(y,\\varphi[y/x]))\\in R).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{AlphaCong}_S(R)\\iff{}&amp;R\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}(S)^2\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\\ (\\varphi,\\varphi)\\in R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\\ ((\\varphi,\\psi)\\in R\\Rightarrow(\\psi,\\varphi)\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\\ ((\\varphi,\\psi)\\in R\\land(\\psi,\\theta)\\in R\\Rightarrow(\\varphi,\\theta)\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathsf b\\in\\{\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{imp}\\}\\ \\forall\\varphi,\\varphi&#39;,\\psi,\\psi&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad((\\varphi,\\varphi&#39;)\\in R\\land(\\psi,\\psi&#39;)\\in R\\Rightarrow(\\mathsf b(\\varphi,\\psi),\\mathsf b(\\varphi&#39;,\\psi&#39;))\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Q\\in\\{\\mathsf{all},\\mathsf{ex}\\}\\ \\forall x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_S\\ \\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad((\\varphi,\\psi)\\in R\\Rightarrow(Q(x,\\varphi),Q(x,\\psi))\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Q\\in\\{\\mathsf{all},\\mathsf{ex}\\}\\ \\forall s\\in S_0\\ \\forall x,y\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad(y\\notin\\operatorname{Vars}(\\varphi)\\cup\\{x\\}\\Rightarrow(Q(x,\\varphi),Q(y,\\varphi[y/x]))\\in R).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha\\ :=\\ \\bigcap\\{R\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}(S)^2\\mid\\operatorname{AlphaCong}_S(R)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha\\ :=\\ \\bigcap\\{R\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}(S)^2\\mid\\operatorname{AlphaCong}_S(R)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_S(\\vec x,\\vec y):=\\prod_{i=1}^n\\operatorname{Term}_{S,\\operatorname{sort}(x_i)}(\\vec y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_S(\\vec x,\\vec y):=\\prod_{i=1}^n\\operatorname{Term}_{S,\\operatorname{sort}(x_i)}(\\vec y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z_i:=\\operatorname{Fresh}_{\\operatorname{sort}(x_i)}\\left(\\operatorname{Vars}(u)\\cup\\bigcup_{j=1}^n\\operatorname{Vars}(t_j)\\cup\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n,z_1,\\ldots,z_{i-1}\\}\\right)\\quad(1\\le i\\le n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z_i:=\\operatorname{Fresh}_{\\operatorname{sort}(x_i)}\\left(\\operatorname{Vars}(u)\\cup\\bigcup_{j=1}^n\\operatorname{Vars}(t_j)\\cup\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n,z_1,\\ldots,z_{i-1}\\}\\right)\\quad(1\\le i\\le n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subst}(u,\\vec x,\\sigma):=u[z_1/x_1]\\cdots[z_n/x_n][t_1/z_1]\\cdots[t_n/z_n],\\qquad\\operatorname{Subst}(u,(),()):=u.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Subst}(u,\\vec x,\\sigma):=u[z_1/x_1]\\cdots[z_n/x_n][t_1/z_1]\\cdots[t_n/z_n],\\qquad\\operatorname{Subst}(u,(),()):=u.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>各语法树有限，每类变量有无限多个，故 Fresh 的最小编号存在。量词替换的三个分支互斥且覆盖全部输入；新鲜改名不会捕获，随后对更低树高的量词体作替换，因此定义为全函数。AlphaCong 的候选全集存在，交给出包含新鲜约束变量改名的最小同余。</p>\n<p>同时替换先把所有被替换变量改成不出现在原树和全部替换项中的中介变量，再逐个放入替换项；因此不会把已放入项中的自由变量再次替换。该构造统一供 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f9eae1f4309444c6\" href=\"?note=f9eae1f4309444c6\" title=\"14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction\">14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction</a> 的推导规则与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"659a7609f5640bba\" href=\"?note=659a7609f5640bba\" title=\"14-thm-categorical-substitution-lemma\">14-thm-categorical-substitution-lemma</a> 的语义替换引理使用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms","status":"resolved","id":"0d0e27d414f41634","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e987275dbc75bae6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms","status":"resolved","id":"0d0e27d414f41634","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]] 的签名；项、上下文与公式采用 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]、[[14-df-formula]] 的有限树编码。$u$ 遍历项和公式，$\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)$；$x,y,z\\in\\operatorname{Var}_S$，单替换中的 $t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{S,\\operatorname{sort}(x)}$。$\\mathsf b\\in\\{\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{imp}\\}$，$Q\\in\\{\\mathsf{all},\\mathsf{ex}\\}$。$\\operatorname{FV}$ 在项上的定义见 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms","status":"resolved","id":"0d0e27d414f41634","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]] 的签名；项、上下文与公式采用 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]、[[14-df-formula]] 的有限树编码。$u$ 遍历项和公式，$\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)$；$x,y,z\\in\\operatorname{Var}_S$，单替换中的 $t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{S,\\operatorname{sort}(x)}$。$\\mathsf b\\in\\{\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{imp}\\}$，$Q\\in\\{\\mathsf{all},\\mathsf{ex}\\}$。$\\operatorname{FV}$ 在项上的定义见 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]。","embe