rall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\\\\\n&\\qquad((\\varphi,\\psi)\\in R\\Rightarrow(Q(x,\\varphi),Q(x,\\psi))\\in R)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall Q\\in\\{\\mathsf{all},\\mathsf{ex}\\}\\ \\forall s\\in S_0\\ \\forall x,y\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\\\\\n&\\qquad(y\\notin\\operatorname{Vars}(\\varphi)\\cup\\{x\\}\\Rightarrow(Q(x,\\varphi),Q(y,\\varphi[y/x]))\\in R).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\equiv_\\alpha\\ :=\\ \\bigcap\\{R\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}(S)^2\\mid\\operatorname{AlphaCong}_S(R)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_S(\\vec x,\\vec y):=\\prod_{i=1}^n\\operatorname{Term}_{S,\\operatorname{sort}(x_i)}(\\vec y).","display":true},{"tex":"z_i:=\\operatorname{Fresh}_{\\operatorname{sort}(x_i)}\\left(\\operatorname{Vars}(u)\\cup\\bigcup_{j=1}^n\\operatorname{Vars}(t_j)\\cup\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n,z_1,\\ldots,z_{i-1}\\}\\right)\\quad(1\\le i\\le n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Subst}(u,\\vec x,\\sigma):=u[z_1/x_1]\\cdots[z_n/x_n][t_1/z_1]\\cdots[t_n/z_n],\\qquad\\operatorname{Subst}(u,(),()):=u.","display":true}],"bytes":5611,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-211","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution|Definition — 自由变量与无捕获替换]]"},{"id":"f9eae1f4309444c6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]] 的签名。几何公式集合 $\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S$ 采用 [[14-df-finitary-geometric-formula]]；$\\operatorname{Ctx}_S$、$|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}$ 与 $\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s}(\\vec x)$ 采用 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]；自由变量、$\\equiv_\\alpha$、单项及同时替换采用 [[14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution]]。$\\mathbb T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Seq}_S$，$D$ 是候选可导序列集合。"},{"id":"c22badb838a7fca1","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在量词各式中，$x:s$ 是原公式的约束变量，$z=z_{\\vec x,x,\\varphi}$ 由下式指定；$\\mathrm{Vars}$、$\\mathrm{Fresh}_s$ 和无捕获替换 